E AX2004 935-removed-foreign.ax:1:2-9 removed-construct "`foreign` is no longer part of Axiom" #"`foreign` was removed because it never worked: it emitted a call to a symbol the module never declared, so a program using one passed `check` and died in `opt`. The FFI is the `extern` block" ?"write an `extern` block instead - `(extern \"lib\" (name :: (-> Int Int) (symbol \"sym\")))` - and build with `--link-lib`/`--link-search`; or reach the kernel through the standard library's `__syscall0`-`__syscall6`, which needs no FFI"
